    {
      "fileName": "kishin-rage.json",
      "id": "zknpo51jJndv68Ph",
      "name": "Kishin Rage",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "zknpo51jJndv68Ph",
        "folder": "UduQItW59597Fjgy",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Kishin Rage",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>Your eyes glow a deep red and your body courses with adrenaline as you obtain a fraction of the power of the kishin oni. You attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Demoralize] all creatures within a 10- foot radius; you don't take a penalty when you attempt to Demoralize a creature that doesn't understand your language.</p>\n<p>You also gain the following abilities for 1 minute.</p><ul><li>40 temporary Hit Points.</li><li>A fly Speed equal to your Speed.</li><li>The effects of 6th-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Runic Body], and your horns deal an additional @Damage[1d4[electricity]] damage.</li><li>Bloodsense as a precise sense with a range of 60 feet, allowing you to detect freshly spilled blood; this allows you to accurately detect creatures taking persistent bleed damage, creatures whose Hit Points are currently at half or less of their maximum, and freestanding puddles or droplets of recently spilled blood.</li></ul><p>Kishin Rage lasts for 1 minute. Once it ends, you're @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 3} as you recharge and recenter yourself.</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "day"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 17
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "selfEffect": {
            "name": "Effect: Kishin Rage",
            "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Kishin Rage"
          },
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "hungerseed",
              "morph",
              "primal"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 17,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "oni-form.json",
      "id": "iCNNMJeGvsIzza4A",
      "name": "Oni Form",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "iCNNMJeGvsIzza4A",
        "folder": "UduQItW59597Fjgy",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Oni Form",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your horns flash briefly as you grow in size and ferocity. Your size increases to Large, and you're @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1}. This doesn't change your Speed, reach, or other statistics except as noted here. Your worn equipment automatically resizes to suit your new form, though it immediately returns to its original size if it leaves your possession.</p>\n<p>This form is the same age and body type as your true form and has roughly analogous physical traits, such as hair color. Using Oni Form counts as creating a disguise for the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Impersonate] use of Deception.</p>\n<p>You can Sustain your Oni Form for up to 10 minutes, though you must then spend at least 10 minutes in your natural form before using Oni Form again.</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "PT10M"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "selfEffect": {
            "name": "Effect: Oni Form",
            "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Oni Form"
          },
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "concentrate",
              "hungerseed",
              "polymorph",
              "primal"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
